.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/e6/Belonging-300705.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">执剑之人<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">The Swords-Hand</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>镶嵌铆钉的臂甲，覆盖有鱼鳞般的金属甲叶，将无形之物锁在有形之中。曾为受访者本人，如今以神秘术为依托得以重现。“无形没什么不好，但无名……无名总像骑士旅途中绊脚的石子。”</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-300706.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/dd/Belonging-300706.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">嵌金皮革挂饰<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Gold Leather Chain</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />3.4<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>缀有金属片的皮革带，看似华而不实的斗篷装饰品。它们会在战斗中晃到敌人的眼睛——这副铠甲连装饰物都如此英勇。</div></div></div></div></div><div id=\"全新语音\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.85.A8.E6.96.B0.E8.AF.AD.E9.9F.B3_New_Voice\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"全新语音_New_Voice\">全新语音<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">New Voice</span></small></span></h2><div><table class=\"wikitable responsive voice-table\" style=\"margin:0; --size: 23px; width:100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"hide-m\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\"><td style=\"text-align:c